4. **For each agent prompt below:** copy the entire fenced block (everything between `--- PROMPT START ---` and `--- PROMPT END ---`) and paste it as the first message in a fresh agent. The agent will produce a plan artifact first, then a diff, then a walkthrough document. Review the artifact before approving execution.
