After deploy:
1. Open `praxis.tacitus.me` in browser DevTools
2. Check Network → Response Headers → `Content-Security-Policy` — should NOT contain `'unsafe-inline'` in script-src
3. Check Console — should be no CSP violation errors
4. Confirm Firebase Auth still works (Google sign-in)
5. Confirm the JSON-LD in the landing page doesn't trigger a CSP error

